From 4e4996ff83678a4d93b80fd4836884f21149a20b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PocketForge Worker <worker@pocketforge.invalid>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 18:46:54 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] hw/misc: add bounded AXP717 register bank

Expose only the IRQ and regulator registers required by the mainline AXP717 MFD/regulator drivers, attach the PMIC at the board DT address, and cover positive register paths plus an adjacent-address NACK in one qtest invocation.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 hw/arm/Kconfig                             |   1 +
 hw/arm/pocketforge_a133.c                  |   2 +
 hw/misc/axp2xx.c                           |  68 ++++++++++++-
 tests/qtest/meson.build                    |   3 +-
 tests/qtest/pocketforge-a133-axp717-test.c | 108 +++++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 179 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 tests/qtest/pocketforge-a133-axp717-test.c

